  {
    "description": "Places an image with its top-left corner at (x, y): from SVG markup you write (illustrations, icons, diagrams) or from an image URL (the server must allow cross-origin requests). Give exactly one of svg or url. Without width and height, the image's own size is used, fitted into 300×300. Returns its ID.",
