      "required": [
        "from",
        "to",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "connect",
  },
  {
    "description": "Draws a straight or curved line or arrow from \`from\` to \`to\`, like the line tool. Each end is a free point or an object; an end on an object follows it when it moves, so one end can point at an object while the other stays put. Returns its ID.",
